erName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3898746594,"text":"特に最後のコンビネーションはすごかったぞ！","nextNodeIds":[150480805]},{"nodeId":150480805,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":257270610,"text":"不運の連鎖を断ち切れたね。","nextNodeIds":[150480806]},{"nodeId":150480806,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21844,"speakerName":"ベネット","textMapHash":3583693778,"text":"ああ！","nextNodeIds":[150480807]},{"nodeId":150480807,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21844,"speakerName":"ベネット","textMapHash":1657302906,"text":"お前には感謝しないとな、旅人。","nextNodeIds":[150480808]},{"nodeId":150480808,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21844,"speakerName":"ベネット","textMapHash":2356583826,"text":"お前がオレを信じて、スタッフを説得してくれてなかったら…困難をこいつと共に乗り越えるチャンスもなかった。","nextNodeIds":[150480809]},{"nodeId":150480809,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21871,"speakerName":"ガウン","textMapHash":3733968314,"text":"最後の安全テスト、クリアだね。これでランニング・アシャは正式にオープンできる——ベネットさん、協力してくれて本当にありがとう。","nextNodeIds":[150480810]},{"nodeId":150480810,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21844,"speakerName":"ベネット","textMapHash":621283274,"text":"アシャ、聞いたか？オレたち、やったぞ！","nextNodeIds":[150480811]},{"nodeId":150480811,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21871,"speakerName":"ガウン","textMapHash":2984803450,"text":"…あなたは親切で勇敢な冒険者だ。ベネットさん、お名前は忘れないよ。","nextNodeIds":[150480812]},{"nodeId":150480812,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21844,"speakerName":"ベネット","textMapHash":1390353418,"text":"まだまだ冒険は続くけど、なんか、アシャと別れるのがどんどん辛くなってくるな。","nextNodeIds":[150480813]},{"nodeId":150480813,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21844,"speakerName":"ベネット","textMapHash":246263370,"text":"アシャ、お前がいなくなると、きっと寂しいぜ。","nextNodeIds":[150480814]},{"nodeId":150480814,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21856,"speakerName":"アシャ","textMapHash":1169436290,"text":"……","nextNodeIds":[150480815]},{"nodeId":150480815,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21844,"speakerName":"ベネット","textMapHash":3646411170,"text":"いや…お前に慰めてもらうなんてダメだな。オレは団長なんだから、オレのほうが団員を助けて、慰めるべきだ。","nextNodeIds":[150480816]},{"nodeId":150480816,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21856,"speakerName":"アシャ","textMapHash":3840193314,"text":"……","nextNodeIds":[150480817]},{"nodeId":150480817,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21844,"speakerName":"ベネット","textMapHash":3691061778,"text":"おかしいな、感情が昂りすぎたのか？目頭が熱くなって、言葉がうまく出てこなくなっちまった。はは…","nextNodeIds":[150480818]},{"nodeId":150480818,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21844,"speakerName":"ベネット","textMapHash":3197430666,"text":"後でウェンティ先生に、こういう時はどんな言葉で気持ちを表現すればいいか、教えてもらわないと…","nextNodeIds":[150480819]},{"nodeId":150480819,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2292308770,"text":"吟遊野郎はきっとこういうぞ…","nextNodeIds":[150480820]},{"nodeId":150480820,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":152304314,"text":"——言いたいことを言えばいい。","nextNodeIds":[150480821]},{"nodeId":150480821,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21844,"speakerName":"ベネット","textMapHash":989257154,"text":"お前がいてくれてよかった…ありがとな、アシャ…","nextNodeIds":[150480822]},{"nodeId":150480822,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21856,"speakerName":"アシャ","textMapHash":492295514,"text":"……","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[1504808,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["133521014"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_UNREGISTER_DYNAMIC_GROUP"},{"LNHLPKELCAL":["133521073"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_UNREGISTER_DYNAMIC_GROUP"},{"LNHLPKELCAL":["45004103"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_EXIT_VEHICLE"},{"LNHLPKELCAL":["30019","3"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_CLEAR_FEATURE_TAG_VEHICLE"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QU